{"id":"5422fa2d4aa74b03","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md","title":"ZFC Model2 Interpretation Function","display":"df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function — ZFC Model2 Interpretation Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function","58-df-zfc-model5-interpretation-function"],"display":"df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function — ZFC Model2 Interpretation Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-model5-interpretation-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function — ZFC Model2 Interpretation Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1214dfa97a3efe0f\" href=\"?note=1214dfa97a3efe0f\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (interpretation function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> (five-component language signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1214dfa97a3efe0f\" href=\"?note=1214dfa97a3efe0f\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(M\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-argument function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S\\)</span> (language-signature predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1214dfa97a3efe0f\" href=\"?note=1214dfa97a3efe0f\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\land L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land M\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,C\\cup F\\cup R,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land I[C]\\subseteq M\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(I(f):M^{a_F(f)}\\to M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;(I(r)\\subseteq M^{a_R(r)})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\land L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land M\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,C\\cup F\\cup R,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land I[C]\\subseteq M\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(I(f):M^{a_F(f)}\\to M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;(I(r)\\subseteq M^{a_R(r)})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>Function and relation symbols now use their distinct arity maps, and the interpretation graph is checked by the actual three-argument function predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature","status":"resolved","id":"1214dfa97a3efe0f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ (interpretation function, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature","status":"resolved","id":"1214dfa97a3efe0f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ (five-component language signature, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (three-argument function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature","status":"resolved","id":"1214dfa97a3efe0f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S$ (language-signature predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\land L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\land M\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,C\\cup F\\cup R,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land I[C]\\subseteq M\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(I(f):M^{a_F(f)}\\to M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;(I(r)\\subseteq M^{a_R(r)})","display":true}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"53133cedc313983a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U)$ (interpretation-function predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2744","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md|58-df-zfc-model2-interp